This mod adds configurable interface scaling to the Steam version of Cookie Clicker. Useful for 4k displays where the standard interface appears too small - this is the reason this mod exists, to fix my problem.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Scale the interface from 50% to 300%
[*]Adjust scaling in 25% increments
[*]Controls integrated into Cookie Clicker's Options menu
[*]Keyboard shortcuts for quick adjustments
[*]Does not sync across computers - you don't want to apply 4k scaling to your Steam Deck
[*]Steam achievements remain enabled
[/list]

[h2]Controls[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Ctrl + Plus[/b] — increase scale
[*][b]Ctrl + Minus[/b] — decrease scale
[*][b]Ctrl + 0[/b] — reset to 100% (default)
[/list]
You can also use the slider and buttons at the top of the Options menu.

[h2]Installation[/h2]
[list=1]
[*]Subscribe to this Workshop item.
[*]Launch Cookie Clicker.
[*]Open [b]Options → Manage Mods[/b].
[*]Enable [b]UI Scaler[/b] and restart the game when prompted.
[/list]
[h2]Compatibility[/h2]

This mod has not dependencies.
This mod changes the visual scale of the interface and does not alter gameplay.
Due to having to modify a lot of things in UI to ensure correct positioning of all elements, compatibility with other UI mods is not guaranteed.

